## Reproducibility

Every run's `manifest.json` (under `evaluation/results/runs/<suite>/<run_id>/`) records the exact config hash, git commit, and package versions that produced it — re-run with the same config against the same commit to reproduce a result, or diff two manifests to see exactly what changed between two reports.
